  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only singleprofile baseline without fusion, achieving validation accuracy of 0.4849 and F1 of 0.4639, lower than the previous multimodal setup's 0.5266 accuracy and 0.5104 F1. The results suggest multimodal approaches may offer benefits, but the role of fusion strategies and other factors remains unclear without further isolation."
